#' @param skip_invalid If \code{TRUE}, silently drop invalid properties
#'   instead of raising an error.
#' @return A \code{go_layout_newselection} object (a named list).
#'
#' @concept layout objects
#' @noMd
#' @export
#' @examples
#' go_figure() |>
